flowchart LR
  %% Figure 2.11: Human-state observation validity
  audio_valid["Valid audio features"]
  audio_invalid["Audio present; required features unusable"]
  text["Text-only request"]
  measured["Observation valid; emotion may be Neutral"]
  unmeasured["Not measured / unknown; observation_valid=false"]
  source["Text source=text_only; invalid audio remains audio-sourced"]
  fusion["Do not fuse unmeasured values as fresh observations"]
  ui["UI says Not measured; hides emotion meters"]
  audio_valid -->|valid features| measured
  audio_invalid -->|invalid features| unmeasured
  text -->|no audio observation| unmeasured
  measured -->|measured state| fusion
  unmeasured -->|retain source metadata| source
  source -->|validity-aware handling| fusion
  fusion -->|display state| ui
